QuickJS-ng JavaScript engine
============================

These files are an unmodified copy of the engine core of QuickJS-ng,
released under the MIT licence (see LICENSE).

  Upstream: https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs
  Version:  v0.17.0
  Commit:   6d46d07d04041b40f4f49eaa7fdebe44c314c699

Only the engine is included: quickjs-libc, the qjs/qjsc tools, tests
and the build files are omitted.

To update, copy the same set of files from a newer upstream release
and change the version details above. Do not edit these files;
NetSurf specific configuration belongs in the parent directory.
